{
  "name": "failed_workflow_3_v2",
  "goal": "Given a GitHub issue, systematically reproduce, diagnose, fix, and verify the issue through a structured multi-phase workflow.",
  "parameters": [
    {
      "name": "code_path",
      "base_type": "TString",
      "predicates": [
        {
          "kind": "isValidFilePath"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "problem_statement",
      "base_type": "TString",
      "predicates": [
        {
          "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "regression_test_cmd",
      "base_type": "TString",
      "predicates": [
        {
          "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "name": "explore_and_understand",
      "step_type": "step",
      "reads": [
        {
          "name": "problem_statement",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        }
      ],
      "writes": [
        {
          "name": "exploration_summary",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        }
      ],
      "instruction": "Phase 1: Codebase Exploration & Issue Understanding\n\nYou are a software engineer. Your working directory is /testbed.\nYour goal in this phase is to understand the codebase structure and the issue.\n\n{{problem_statement}}\n\nStep 1: Explore the repository structure\nStep 2: Understand the issue\nStep 3: Locate relevant source files\n\nDeliverable:\n1. Repository structure\n2. Issue summary\n3. Relevant files\n4. Initial hypothesis\n\nIMPORTANT: Do NOT modify any files in this phase.\n",
      "precond_extra": [
        {
          "var_name": "shell_run",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "toolExists"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "problem_statement",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        }
      ],
      "postcond_extra": [
        {
          "var_name": "exploration_summary",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        }
      ],
      "step_tag": {
        "kind": "exploratory"
      },
      "sub_goal_contributions": [
        {
          "sub_goal_name": "codebase_explored"
        }
      ],
      "implicit_retries": [
        {
          "sub_goal_name": "codebase_explored"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "reproduce_issue",
      "step_type": "step",
      "reads": [
        {
          "name": "exploration_summary",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        }
      ],
      "writes": [
        {
          "name": "reproduction_result",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        }
      ],
      "instruction": "Phase 2: Issue Reproduction\n\nBased on the exploration from Phase 1:\n{{exploration_summary}}\n\nCreate a minimal reproduction script that demonstrates the bug.\n\nDeliverable:\n1. Reproduction script path\n2. Reproduction output\n3. Root cause analysis\n",
      "precond_extra": [
        {
          "var_name": "shell_run",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "toolExists"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "exploration_summary",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        }
      ],
      "postcond_extra": [
        {
          "var_name": "reproduction_result",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "reproduction_result",
          "aspect": "reproduction_script_path"
        }
      ],
      "step_tag": {
        "kind": "transformative"
      },
      "sub_goal_contributions": [
        {
          "sub_goal_name": "issue_reproduced"
        }
      ],
      "implicit_retries": [
        {
          "sub_goal_name": "issue_reproduced"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "name": "implement_fix",
      "step_type": "step",
      "reads": [
        {
          "name": "reproduction_result",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        }
      ],
      "writes": [
        {
          "name": "fix_summary",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        }
      ],
      "instruction": "Phase 3: Implement the Fix\n\nBased on the reproduction from Phase 2:\n{{reproduction_result}}\n\nEdit the source code to fix the issue. Make MINIMAL changes.\n\nDeliverable:\n1. Files modified\n2. Changes made\n3. Rationale\n",
      "precond_extra": [
        {
          "var_name": "shell_run",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "toolExists"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "reproduction_result",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        }
      ],
      "postcond_extra": [
        {
          "var_name": "fix_summary",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "fix_summary",
          "aspect": "files_modified"
        }
      ],
      "step_tag": {
        "kind": "transformative"
      },
      "sub_goal_contributions": [
        {
          "sub_goal_name": "fix_implemented"
        }
      ],
      "implicit_retries": [
        {
          "sub_goal_name": "fix_implemented"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "name": "verify_fix",
      "step_type": "step",
      "reads": [
        {
          "name": "fix_summary",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        }
      ],
      "writes": [
        {
          "name": "verification_result",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        }
      ],
      "instruction": "Phase 4: Verify the Fix\n\nBased on the fix from Phase 3:\n{{fix_summary}}\n\nVerify that the fix resolves the issue without regressions.\n\nDeliverable:\n1. Reproduction result\n2. Edge case results\n3. Regression test results\n4. Final status: VERIFIED or NEEDS_REVISION\n",
      "precond_extra": [
        {
          "var_name": "shell_run",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "toolExists"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "fix_summary",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        }
      ],
      "postcond_extra": [
        {
          "var_name": "verification_result",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "verification_result",
          "aspect": "verification_status"
        }
      ],
      "step_tag": {
        "kind": "verificatory"
      },
      "sub_goal_contributions": [
        {
          "sub_goal_name": "fix_verified"
        }
      ],
      "sub_goal_verifications": [
        {
          "sub_goal_name": "fix_implemented"
        }
      ],
      "implicit_retries": [
        {
          "sub_goal_name": "fix_verified"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "name": "generate_patch",
      "step_type": "task",
      "reads": [
        {
          "name": "verification_result",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        },
        {
          "name": "fix_summary",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        }
      ],
      "writes": [
        {
          "name": "patch_generation_result",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        }
      ],
      "instruction": "Phase 5a: Generate the Patch\n\nThe fix has been verified:\n{{verification_result}}\n\nThe files that were modified during the fix:\n{{fix_summary}}\n\nGenerate a git diff patch containing ONLY the source file changes.\nDo NOT include test files, helper scripts, or configuration files.\n",
      "precond_extra": [
        {
          "var_name": "shell_run",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "toolExists"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "verification_result",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "verification_result",
          "aspect": "verification_status"
        },
        {
          "var_name": "fix_summary",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "fix_summary",
          "aspect": "files_modified"
        }
      ],
      "postcond_extra": [
        {
          "var_name": "patch_generation_result",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "patch_generation_result",
          "aspect": "patch_file_path"
        }
      ],
      "step_tag": {
        "kind": "transformative"
      },
      "sub_goal_contributions": [
        {
          "sub_goal_name": "patch_created"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "name": "verify_patch",
      "step_type": "task",
      "reads": [
        {
          "name": "patch_generation_result",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        }
      ],
      "writes": [
        {
          "name": "patch_verification_result",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        }
      ],
      "instruction": "Phase 5b: Verify the Patch\n\nA patch was generated in the previous step:\n{{patch_generation_result}}\n\nRead and inspect /testbed/patch.txt.\nVerify that the patch contains ONLY intended source file changes.\n\nReturn either:\n- PATCH_VERIFIED if the patch is correct\n- A description of what needs to be fixed if it is not\n",
      "precond_extra": [
        {
          "var_name": "shell_run",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "toolExists"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "patch_generation_result",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "patch_generation_result",
          "aspect": "patch_file_path"
        }
      ],
      "postcond_extra": [
        {
          "var_name": "patch_verification_result",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "patch_verification_result",
          "aspect": "patch_status"
        }
      ],
      "step_tag": {
        "kind": "verificatory"
      },
      "sub_goal_contributions": [
        {
          "sub_goal_name": "patch_verified"
        }
      ],
      "sub_goal_verifications": [
        {
          "sub_goal_name": "patch_created"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "name": "submit_patch",
      "step_type": "task",
      "reads": [
        {
          "name": "patch_verification_result",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        }
      ],
      "writes": [
        {
          "name": "issue_solution",
          "base_type": "TString",
          "predicates": []
        }
      ],
      "instruction": "Phase 5c: Submit the Patch\n\nThe patch has been verified:\n{{patch_verification_result}}\n\nSubmit the patch using this EXACT command:\n```\necho COMPLETE_TASK_AND_SUBMIT_FINAL_OUTPUT && cat /testbed/patch.txt\n```\n\nCRITICAL: You CANNOT continue working after submission.\n",
      "precond_extra": [
        {
          "var_name": "shell_run",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "toolExists"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "patch_verification_result",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "patch_verification_result",
          "aspect": "patch_status"
        }
      ],
      "postcond_extra": [
        {
          "var_name": "issue_solution",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "isNonEmptyString"
          }
        },
        {
          "var_name": "issue_solution",
          "predicate": {
            "kind": "containsSubstring",
            "substring": "COMPLETE_TASK_AND_SUBMIT_FINAL_OUTPUT"
          }
        }
      ],
      "step_tag": {
        "kind": "transformative"
      },
      "sub_goal_contributions": [
        {
          "sub_goal_name": "patch_submitted"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
